This directory bundles third-party Lua extension libraries that are
licensed under the MIT License, rather than the GPL that covers the
rest of apt-rpm:

  lposix.c, lposix.h, linit.h, modemuncher.c, userconfig.c
    POSIX library for Lua.
    Copyright (C) 1994-2012 Lua.org, PUC-Rio.
    Based on the original by Claudio Terra for Lua 3.x.
    Luiz Henrique de Figueiredo <lhf@tecgraf.puc-rio.br>

  lrexlib.c, lrexlib.h
    POSIX & PCRE regular expression library for Lua.
    Copyright (C) Reuben Thomas 2000-2004.

  luacompat.h
    Copyright (C) apt-rpm contributors.

